claim.claim-text:
a fiber-resin composite elliptical ovoid shell having an axial shaft;
a hub boss plate on each side of the ovoid shell, the hub boss plates concentrically disposed within and outside the shell and attached to the axial shaft; and
a plurality of radially oriented, fiber-resin composite helical wraps coupling the shell to the hub boss plates for co-rotation and torque transfer to the axial shaft;
an axially oriented internal compressive support between the axial walls of the elliptical ovoid shell; and
wherein upon rotation, the elliptical ovoid shell elongates slightly to increase a moment of inertia about the elliptical ovoid shell.
